# UI and feel

Supreme spec: `docs/design/DESIGN.md` (CineXOX Tasarım Anayasası). Every UI change must conform to its rules.
Visual mix: Letterboxd calm + Block Blast one-touch clarity + Wordle daily ritual + 35mm analog. Tokens live in `tailwind.config.ts`.

Do not rebuild these without an explicit request:
- `MatchmakingQueueModal.tsx` (gold reel animation timings)
- `ShotClock.tsx` (neon core + ping radar)
- `XoxBoard.tsx` 4x4 matrix (corner clapper, axis badges, 35mm plates)

Keyboard-open: board and shot-clock stay visible (`100dvh`). Search cards must not leak genre/year/Oscar hints into the DOM.
